[sliver] The 1.2 mm lands retain the full 1.8 mm lip projection for five 0.24 mm layers before the 45-degree insertion nose. Each is 8 mm wide and attached to the 1.3 mm stem. The native slice retains the full 3.10–3.115 mm stem-plus-lip section for those five layers and supplies a support interface beneath each square bearing face. Printed edge finish is a physical coupon reading.
